  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "地形測量",
    "sub_ename": "TOPOGRAPHIC SURVEYING",
    "describe_ch": "地形測量為所有工程建設之基礎科學，舉凡土木工程、建築工程、交通工程…等，皆需藉由地形測量，得到工程設計所需之基本資料。本課程旨在使學生瞭解地形測量原理及作業技術與製圖方法，並熟練測量儀器之操作及維護，使理論與實際結合。",
    "describe_eh": "Topographic surveying is the basic science of all engineering constructions, such as civil engineering, architectural engineering, and traffic engineering etc..  The database for engineering design must be obtained by topographic surveying. The objective of this course is to understand the principles, operation techniques, and drafting methods of the topographic surveying. The students are skilled at operating and maintaining the surveying instruments to make for the union of the theory and practice.",
